MM made markets in this asset class and liquidity profile?\n- Does it have adequate staffing, technology, and surveillance capacity?\n- What is its record on quoting compliance?\n\n**Capital and seed support**\n- Is the seed a temporary market-maker commitment or lasting investor capital?\n- What are the duration, exit terms, and unwind mechanics?\n- Does any support create fee dependence, exclusivity, or influence over fund decisions? Is it disclosed?\n\n**Temporary vs. lasting**\n- Market-maker seed is typically short-term, inventory-based, and should exit as organic liquidity develops.\n- Investor assets should be judged on durable flows and retention, not on seed.","ttft_ms":3104,"type":"result","duration_ms":4592,"uuid":"df692bbb-f5aa-441a-ac59-8d32ce5bd553","ttft_stream_ms":392,"time_to_request_ms":51,"first_content_frame_ms":392,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
